# CREDITS — One Lamp Across

A 39-second film in the Shadow Puppetry style, made entirely in code.
The river, the ferryman, the child and the crossing are invented.

## Voice
Speech synthesis: Kokoro (kokoro-onnx), voice `af_heart`, English. Model and engine
are released under the licences of the kokoro-onnx project
(https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx). Offline synthesis.

## Music and sound effects
Original score and foley, synthesised for this film (`score.py`, `mix.py`).
No sample library. No recording of a traditional piece.

## Typefaces
- Cormorant Garamond — SIL Open Font License 1.1 (Catharsis Fonts); see `fonts/OFL.txt`

## Picture
Every frame is drawn with this film's hide, carving and lamp compositor
(`engine/sprites.js`, `engine/composite.js`, `engine/rig.js`, `engine/stage.js`).
No stock footage, no photographs, no third-party images.
